WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.400
Here's what done looks like.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:04.475
Every Kerberos account
has a reviewed decision.

3
00:00:04.475 --> 00:00:08.263
The root key was checked without
anyone holding administrator rights.

4
00:00:08.263 --> 00:00:13.347
Retrievers match the reviewed list, no
migration broke the limits or finished early,

5
00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:17.850
and every plan was approved by someone
other than the person who applied it.

6
00:00:17.850 --> 00:00:19.100
Nothing was deleted.

7
00:00:19.100 --> 00:00:23.272
Every island account has an owner
and an end date inside the deadline,

8
00:00:23.272 --> 00:00:26.712
and every managed account
has a reconciled destination.

9
00:00:26.712 --> 00:00:29.181
With the Kerberos accounts accounted for,

10
00:00:29.181 --> 00:00:32.637
Chapter 7 turns to least
privilege for service principals.

11
00:00:32.637 --> 00:00:33.790
Thanks for watching.
